---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Padma Pura Foundation"
	description="Padma Pura Foundation supports the Dharma activity of Tenzin Samphel Rinpoche in the Netherlands."
>
	<section class="pp-opening" aria-labelledby="pp-heading">
		<p class="pp-opening__label">Foundation</p>
		<h1 id="pp-heading">Padma Pura Foundation</h1>
		<div class="pp-opening__intro">
			<p>Padma Pura Foundation supports the Dharma activity of Tenzin Samphel Rinpoche in the Netherlands.</p>
			<p>Through practical organisation, communication and volunteer support, the foundation helps create the conditions for Rinpoche’s visits, teachings, transmissions and practice activities.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="purpose" aria-labelledby="purpose-heading">
		<h2 id="purpose-heading">Our purpose</h2>
		<div class="purpose__prose">
			<p>Padma Pura Foundation exists to support Rinpoche’s Dharma activity in the Netherlands and to help make it possible for students to receive his teachings and guidance and to practise together.</p>
			<p>Its role is practical and supportive: organising visits, facilitating teachings and transmissions, supporting practice activities and taking care of the conditions that allow these activities to take place.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="how-we-work" aria-labelledby="how-we-work-heading">
		<h2 id="how-we-work-heading">How we work</h2>
		<div class="how-we-work__prose">
			<p>Padma Pura Foundation is supported by a small group of people in the Netherlands who take care of the practical organisation around Rinpoche’s Dharma activity.</p>
			<p>This includes coordinating visits, communication, practice activities, accommodation and other practical support. Much of this work is carried by volunteers and students who contribute their time and skills where needed.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="activities-we-support" aria-labelledby="activities-we-support-heading">
		<h2 id="activities-we-support-heading">Activities we support</h2>
		<div class="activities-we-support__prose">
			<p>The foundation supports Rinpoche’s annual visits to the Netherlands, teachings and transmissions, and practice activities including Tsog, Tsetar and Gutor.</p>
		</div>
		<p class="activities-we-support__link"><a href="/activities">Explore Dharma Activity →</a></p>
	</section>

	<section class="foundation-anbi-summary" aria-labelledby="foundation-anbi-summary-heading">
		<h2 id="foundation-anbi-summary-heading">Foundation &amp; ANBI</h2>
		<div class="foundation-anbi-summary__prose">
			<p>Padma Pura Foundation is a Dutch foundation with ANBI status.</p>
			<p>Information about the foundation, its board, policy and other formal documents is available on the Foundation &amp; ANBI page.</p>
		</div>
		<p class="foundation-anbi-summary__link"><a href="/foundation">Foundation &amp; ANBI →</a></p>
	</section>

	<section class="support-summary" aria-labelledby="support-summary-heading">
		<h2 id="support-summary-heading">Support</h2>
		<div class="support-summary__prose">
			<p>Padma Pura Foundation depends on the support of students, practitioners and others who help make Rinpoche’s Dharma activity in the Netherlands possible.</p>
		</div>
		<p class="support-summary__link"><a href="/support">Support Padma Pura Foundation →</a></p>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.pp-opening {
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-block: clamp(var(--space-8), 9vw, 9rem) clamp(var(--space-7), 8vw, 8rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.pp-opening__label {
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		font-weight: 500;
		letter-spacing: 0.02em;
		line-height: 1.4;
	}

	.pp-opening h1 {
		max-width: 16ch;
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 6.5vw, 6rem);
		font-weight: 380;
		letter-spacing: 0;
		line-height: 0.98;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.pp-opening__intro {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: clamp(var(--space-6), 5vw, var(--space-8));
		max-width: none;
		margin-top: clamp(var(--space-7), 6vw, var(--space-9));
	}

	.pp-opening__intro p {
		max-width: 34rem;
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.pp-opening__intro p:last-child {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.purpose {
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-7), 7vw, 7rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.purpose h2,
	.purpose p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.purpose h2 {
		margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 2.5vw, 2.5rem);
		font-weight: 360;
		line-height: 1.05;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.purpose__prose {
		max-width: 42rem;
	}

	.purpose p {
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.purpose p + p {
		margin-top: var(--space-6);
	}

	.how-we-work {
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-7), 7vw, 7rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.how-we-work h2 {
		max-width: none;
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 2.5vw, 2.5rem);
		font-weight: 360;
		line-height: 1.05;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.how-we-work__prose {
		max-width: 42rem;
	}

	.how-we-work__prose p {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.how-we-work__prose p + p {
		margin-top: var(--space-6);
	}

	.activities-we-support {
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-7), 7vw, 7rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.activities-we-support h2 {
		max-width: none;
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 2.5vw, 2.5rem);
		font-weight: 360;
		line-height: 1.05;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.activities-we-support__prose {
		max-width: 38rem;
	}

	.activities-we-support__prose p {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.activities-we-support__prose p + p {
		margin-top: var(--space-5);
	}

	.activities-we-support__link {
		margin: var(--space-6) 0 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.foundation-anbi-summary {
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-7), 7vw, 7rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.foundation-anbi-summary h2 {
		max-width: none;
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 2.5vw, 2.5rem);
		font-weight: 360;
		line-height: 1.05;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.foundation-anbi-summary__prose {
		max-width: 32rem;
	}

	.foundation-anbi-summary__prose p {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.foundation-anbi-summary__prose p + p {
		margin-top: var(--space-5);
	}

	.foundation-anbi-summary__link {
		margin: var(--space-5) 0 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.support-summary {
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-8), 8vw, 7.5rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.support-summary h2 {
		max-width: none;
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 2.5vw, 2.5rem);
		font-weight: 360;
		line-height: 1.05;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.support-summary__prose {
		max-width: 36rem;
	}

	.support-summary__prose p {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.support-summary__link {
		margin: var(--space-5) 0 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	@media (max-width: 48rem) {
		.pp-opening {
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-block: var(--space-8) var(--space-9);
		}

		.pp-opening h1 {
			max-width: none;
			font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 12vw, 4rem);
			line-height: 1.02;
		}

		.pp-opening__intro {
			display: block;
			margin-top: var(--space-7);
		}

		.pp-opening__intro p {
			max-width: none;
			font-size: var(--text-base);
		}

		.pp-opening__intro p:last-child {
			margin: var(--space-6) 0 0;
		}

		.purpose {
			display: block;
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
		}

		.purpose p {
			font-size: var(--text-base);
		}

		.how-we-work {
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
		}

		.how-we-work__prose p {
			font-size: var(--text-base);
		}

		.activities-we-support {
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
		}

		.activities-we-support__prose {
			max-width: none;
		}

		.activities-we-support__prose p {
			font-size: var(--text-base);
		}

		.foundation-anbi-summary {
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
		}

		.foundation-anbi-summary__prose {
			max-width: none;
		}

		.foundation-anbi-summary__prose p {
			font-size: var(--text-base);
		}

		.support-summary {
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
		}

		.support-summary__prose {
			max-width: none;
		}
	}
</style>
